{"id":"ab516fb5dde9de22","group":"29","path":"29/29-df-counting-game.md","title":"有限轮计数卵石游戏","display":"df-counting-game — 有限轮计数卵石游戏","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Descriptive Complexity (Neil Immerman)","book_abbrev":"29","label":"29-df-counting-game","aliases":["29-df-counting-game"],"display":"df-counting-game — 有限轮计数卵石游戏","depends_on":["[[29-df-pebble-game]]"],"source_locator":"Definition 12.18, pp.187–188, DjVu scans 202–203","source_basis":"已逐页核对文本层及页面图像；有限回溯递归为本地形式化"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Descriptive Complexity (Neil Immerman)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"29"},{"key":"label","html":"29-df-counting-game"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>29-df-counting-game</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-counting-game — 有限轮计数卵石游戏"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"da1408963eb3a178\" href=\"?note=da1408963eb3a178\" title=\"29-df-pebble-game\">29-df-pebble-game</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_locator","html":"Definition 12.18, pp.187–188, DjVu scans 202–203"},{"key":"source_basis","html":"已逐页核对文本层及页面图像；有限回溯递归为本地形式化"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\tau\">\\(\\tau\\)</span> 为有限关系词汇，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A,B\\in\\mathrm{STRUC}[\\tau]\">\\(A,B\\in\\mathrm{STRUC}[\\tau]\\)</span> 为非空有限结构；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"k\\geq1\">\\(k\\geq1\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"m,r\\in\\mathbb N\">\\(m,r\\in\\mathbb N\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Pos}_k(A,B)\">\\(\\mathsf{Pos}_k(A,B)\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Legal}(p)\">\\(\\operatorname{Legal}(p)\\)</span> 及位置更新 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p[i\\mapsto(a,b)]\">\\(p[i\\mapsto(a,b)]\\)</span> 取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"da1408963eb3a178\" href=\"?note=da1408963eb3a178\" title=\"29-df-pebble-game\">29-df-pebble-game</a>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p\\in\\mathsf{Pos}_k(A,B)\">\\(p\\in\\mathsf{Pos}_k(A,B)\\)</span>。常量若存在，始终包含在原子一致性检验中。</li>\n<li>下式以剩余轮数递归：先选卵石对及一边的集合，后选另一边的等势集合，再由挑战方在回应集合中挑元素，回应方在原集合中挑元素。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G^{\\mathrm{count}}_{k,m}(A,B)\">\\(G^{\\mathrm{count}}_{k,m}(A,B)\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Duplicator}\\uparrow G^{\\mathrm{count}}_{k,m}(A,B)\">\\(\\mathrm{Duplicator}\\uparrow G^{\\mathrm{count}}_{k,m}(A,B)\\)</span> 分别为下式引入的游戏数据及其初始空位置获胜谓词。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"W^{A,B}_{C,k,0}(p)\\coloneqq\\operatorname{Legal}(p).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[W^{A,B}_{C,k,0}(p)\\coloneqq\\operatorname{Legal}(p).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\nW^{A,B}_{C,k,r+1}(p)\\coloneqq\\operatorname{Legal}(p)\\land\n\\bigwedge_{i=1}^{k}\\Bigl[\n&amp;\\bigl(\\forall E\\subseteq|A|\\;\\exists F\\subseteq|B|\\;\n(|F|=|E|\\land\\forall b\\in F\\;\\exists a\\in E\\;W^{A,B}_{C,k,r}(p[i\\mapsto(a,b)]))\\bigr)\\\\\n\\land{}&amp;\n\\bigl(\\forall F\\subseteq|B|\\;\\exists E\\subseteq|A|\\;\n(|E|=|F|\\land\\forall a\\in E\\;\\exists b\\in F\\;W^{A,B}_{C,k,r}(p[i\\mapsto(a,b)]))\\bigr)\n\\Bigr].\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\nW^{A,B}_{C,k,r+1}(p)\\coloneqq\\operatorname{Legal}(p)\\land\n\\bigwedge_{i=1}^{k}\\Bigl[\n&amp;\\bigl(\\forall E\\subseteq|A|\\;\\exists F\\subseteq|B|\\;\n(|F|=|E|\\land\\forall b\\in F\\;\\exists a\\in E\\;W^{A,B}_{C,k,r}(p[i\\mapsto(a,b)]))\\bigr)\\\\\n\\land{}&amp;\n\\bigl(\\forall F\\subseteq|B|\\;\\exists E\\subseteq|A|\\;\n(|E|=|F|\\land\\forall a\\in E\\;\\exists b\\in F\\;W^{A,B}_{C,k,r}(p[i\\mapsto(a,b)]))\\bigr)\n\\Bigr].\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"G^{\\mathrm{count}}_{k,m}(A,B)\\coloneqq\n\\langle\\mathsf{Pos}_k(A,B),(W^{A,B}_{C,k,r})_{r\\leq m}\\rangle,\\qquad\n\\mathrm{Duplicator}\\uparrow G^{\\mathrm{count}}_{k,m}(A,B)\n\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ W^{A,B}_{C,k,m}(\\varnothing).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[G^{\\mathrm{count}}_{k,m}(A,B)\\coloneqq\n\\langle\\mathsf{Pos}_k(A,B),(W^{A,B}_{C,k,r})_{r\\leq m}\\rangle,\\qquad\n\\mathrm{Duplicator}\\uparrow G^{\\mathrm{count}}_{k,m}(A,B)\n\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ W^{A,B}_{C,k,m}(\\varnothing).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>原书 Definition 12.18，印刷页187–188，扫描页202–203；集合挑战的次序已视觉核对。特别是挑战方第二步挑的是回应方的集合，不能误写成仍在最初集合里挑元素。回溯同时保留两个挑战方向，并允许全部位置；原子不一致的位置从零轮起即败。空集合要求的回应也是空集合，后续全称条件为空真，对胜负无额外限制；一边取全域而另一边没有足够元素时等势条件立即失败。递归只调用严格较小轮数，故对全部位置良定义。本条不把编号到元素对的位置图当作结构间的部分同构。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"29-df-pebble-game","status":"resolved","id":"da1408963eb3a178","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[29-df-pebble-game]]","embed":false},{"target":"29-df-pebble-game","status":"resolved","id":"da1408963eb3a178","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathsf{Pos}_k(A,B)$、$\\operatorname{Legal}(p)$ 及位置更新 $p[i\\mapsto(a,b)]$ 取 [[29-df-pebble-game]]；$p\\in\\mathsf{Pos}_k(A,B)$。常量若存在，始终包含在原子一致性检验中。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\tau","display":false},{"tex":"A,B\\in\\mathrm{STRUC}[\\tau]","display":false},{"tex":"k\\geq1","display":false},{"tex":"m,r\\in\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathsf{Pos}_k(A,B)","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Legal}(p)","display":false},{"tex":"p[i\\mapsto(a,b)]","display":false},{"tex":"p\\in\\mathsf{Pos}_k(A,B)","display":false},{"tex":"G^{\\mathrm{count}}_{k,m}(A,B)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Duplicator}\\uparrow G^{\\mathrm{count}}_{k,m}(A,B)","display":false},{"tex":"W^{A,B}_{C,k,0}(p)\\coloneqq\\operatorname{Legal}(p).","display":true},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\nW^{A,B}_{C,k,r+1}(p)\\coloneqq\\operatorname{Legal}(p)\\land\n\\bigwedge_{i=1}^{k}\\Bigl[\n&\\bigl(\\forall E\\subseteq|A|\\;\\exists F\\subseteq|B|\\;\n(|F|=|E|\\land\\forall b\\in F\\;\\exists a\\in E\\;W^{A,B}_{C,k,r}(p[i\\mapsto(a,b)]))\\bigr)\\\\\n\\land{}&\n\\bigl(\\forall F\\subseteq|B|\\;\\exists E\\subseteq|A|\\;\n(|E|=|F|\\land\\forall a\\in E\\;\\exists b\\in F\\;W^{A,B}_{C,k,r}(p[i\\mapsto(a,b)]))\\bigr)\n\\Bigr].\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"G^{\\mathrm{count}}_{k,m}(A,B)\\coloneqq\n\\langle\\mathsf{Pos}_k(A,B),(W^{A,B}_{C,k,r})_{r\\leq m}\\rangle,\\qquad\n\\mathrm{Duplicator}\\uparrow G^{\\mathrm{count}}_{k,m}(A,B)\n\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ W^{A,B}_{C,k,m}(\\varnothing).","display":true}],"bytes":2529,"backlinks":[{"id":"38909ffa6d1e85ce","anchor":"ref-127","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[29-df-counting-game]]、[[29-df-bijection-game]]、[[29-thm-counting-game-ck]]、[[29-thm-counting-bijection]] — 计数与双射游戏"},{"id":"3f7769b0fc6d1261","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"20e8f6e9b486343b","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"2985e9c09cdf49eb","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"ecc0dd131d213345","anchor":"ref-39","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../29-df-counting-game]]"}],"outgoing":["da1408963eb3a178"]}